---
import Divider from './Divider.astro';
---
<section class="s" id="intro">
  <div class="pin"><div class="inner" id="introInner">
  <Divider n={1} name="Approach" pinned />
  <h2 class="sr">Approach</h2>
  <p class="big" data-words>Most sites are judged at launch. I care more about <em>year three</em>, when the site still has to be <em>fast</em>, <em>stable</em> and <em>easy</em> for the team to run.</p>
  <div class="stats" id="stats"><div><b class="disp"><span data-n="13">13</span><small>yr</small></b> <span>Developing professionally</span></div><div><b class="disp"><span data-n="200">200</span><small>+</small></b> <span>Projects delivered</span></div><div><b class="disp"><span data-n="5">5</span><small>yr</small></b> <span>Longest client relationship</span></div></div>
  </div></div>
</section>
